:''For the other Shirou from the same event, see [[Shirou the Cat (Special Cat)]].''
'''Li'l Shirou''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]] and is unlockable by beating any fixed [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration event stage.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 373
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Li'l Shirou
|name2 = Li'l Shirou CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Li'l Shirou CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Li'l Shirou is completely unusable for a anti-trait meatshield or attacker due to having long cooldown, awkward range and low DPS. While it does have decent health, the overall extreme aggression of black pushers will even overwhelm specialist meatshields like [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono]] and [[Ancient Egg: N103 (Rare Cat)|Gas Mask Cat]] or tanks like [[Maeda Keiji (Uber Rare Cat)|Keiji]] in seconds if given the chance. While it is true that most black threats can be countered by disabling them with [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bomber]], Li'l Shirou cannot even serve as your second line of defense if they indeed break free and cannot be quickly replaced to efficiently stall them in a pinch. Even as a melee unit, Li'l Shirou is outclassed by a talented [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]], who has lower range and single target, but a much faster attack rate and overall DPS which allows her to handle tougher enemies better.

